## Interface: 16001
## Title: Krool World Forever
## Notes: Small quality-of-life features for WoW Forever, each with its own on/off switch: Quest Trash (which quest items you can delete), Kill Value (gold per kill on creature tooltips), Setups (copy bars, keybinds, macros and layouts between characters), Rare Alert (alert and a one-key marker for rare enemies), Disenchant Value (what a green is worth disenchanted), Camp Guide (what a campfire's objects give you), Skill-Up Odds (skill-up chances tuned by your crafts, and the cheapest next point), Sayge's Fortune (when Sayge at the Darkmoon Faire gives your next fortune). /kw
## Author: Krool
## Version: 0.14.0
## Category: Interface Enhancements
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Bag_10
## AddonCompartmentFunc: KroolWorldForever_OnCompartmentClick
## OptionalDeps: QuestieDB, Auctionator
## SavedVariables: KroolWorldForeverDB

